u_N$, $ eta(	au)$, $\gamma(	au)$ are the posterior mean and two constants of this theorem, not the $\mu_t$, $ eta_t$, $\gamma_t$ of this page. Statement. The posterior mean $
u_N$ and standard deviation $\sigma_N$ are continuous, with Lipschitz constant $L_{
